1. Definitions

"Licensor" means Adilson Oliveira, operating the Konaet project under the
7dsolv handle, or a lawful successor that owns the applicable rights.

"Materials" means the source code, model weights, numerical formats,
configurations, documentation, diagrams, reports, manifests, public keys,
signatures, and other artifacts that expressly identify this License.
Third-party components and datasets are excluded unless they expressly state
otherwise.

"Official Release" means Materials whose inventory is signed by a private key
corresponding to a public key published by the Licensor through an official
Konaet channel. A signature attests bytes and release origin; it does not
certify scientific claims or legal title by itself.

"Adaptation" means a modified, fine-tuned, quantized, converted, merged,
distilled, translated, ported, or otherwise derived version of the Materials.

"Non-Commercial Purpose" means research, study, security review, education,
personal experimentation, or internal evaluation that is not primarily
intended for commercial advantage or monetary compensation.

"Commercial Use" means use of the Materials or an Adaptation in connection
with revenue, a paid product or service, advertising, consulting, customer
delivery, commercial model training, a monetized API, or another activity
primarily intended for commercial advantage.

2. Non-commercial grant

Subject to every condition in this License, the Licensor grants You a
worldwide, non-exclusive, royalty-free license to:

a. download, reproduce, run, inspect, and evaluate the Materials for a
   Non-Commercial Purpose;
b. create Adaptations for a Non-Commercial Purpose; and
c. redistribute the Materials or an Adaptation for a Non-Commercial Purpose
   only if You satisfy Sections 3, 4, and 5.

No right to Commercial Use is granted. Commercial Use requires a separate
written agreement signed by the Licensor.

3. Attribution, provenance, and integrity

Every copy or redistribution of the Materials or an Adaptation must:

a. retain this License, COPYRIGHT.md, TRADEMARKS.md, all copyright notices,
   and all attribution and provenance notices;
b. identify the original project as "Konaet / Adilson Oliveira (7dsolv)" and
   provide a link to the originating release where reasonably possible;
c. preserve the original authenticity manifest, detached signature, and
   public key without alteration;
d. identify every material change, its author, and its date in a separate and
   conspicuous modification notice;
e. state clearly that an Adaptation is unofficial and is not cryptographically
   identical to the Official Release;
f. avoid using the original signature or provenance root to authenticate
   altered bytes; and
g. apply this License to the copied or adapted Materials.

You may add a new signature to an Adaptation, but it must use a different key
and must not be presented as a Konaet Official Release signature.

4. Prohibited misrepresentation and removal

You may not:

a. remove, obscure, falsify, or replace authorship, license, attribution,
   provenance, checkpoint lineage, memory lineage, or dataset notices;
b. represent the Materials or an Adaptation as independently authored;
c. represent altered files as byte-identical to an Official Release;
d. forge, reuse deceptively, or misattribute a Konaet signature, key
   fingerprint, release hash, badge, or verification result;
e. imply sponsorship, certification, endorsement, or official status without
   written permission from the Licensor; or
f. bypass technical access controls to obtain artifacts not made available to
   You.

These conditions regulate licensed use of protected Materials. They do not
claim ownership of ideas, facts, mathematical principles, public standards,
or independently created expression.

5. Model training, extraction, and derivatives

For a Non-Commercial Purpose, You may fine-tune, quantize, convert, study, or
distill a Model contained in the Materials. Resulting model artifacts are
Adaptations and remain subject to this License.

Using the Materials, an Adaptation, or systematically collected model outputs
for Commercial Use, commercial training, commercial distillation, commercial
imitation, or a monetized competing service is prohibited without a separate
written agreement.

This Section does not restrict independently developed systems that do not
copy protected Materials and are not derived from them.

6. Benchmarking and research publication

You may publish benchmark results and academic analysis if You accurately
identify the exact evaluated revision, hardware, protocol, limitations, and
provenance, and do not imply endorsement by the Licensor. Negative results may
not be suppressed when their omission would make a published Konaet comparison
materially misleading.

